      "extract": "A FOURIER-FREE DENSITY-INCREMENT PROOF OF ROTH’S THEOREM MARK LEWKO Abstract. We give an elementary, Fourier-free proof of Roth’s theorem. The proof follows Roth’s original density-increment strategy, but replaces the usual Fourier-analytic step with a direct combinatorial argument involving averages over sub-progressions.",
      "extractCut": false,
      "blocks": [
        "library/arxiv-2605.19310v1/blocks/prose-sec-front-matter"
      ]
    },
